---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn how How to Fish Game Help researches, labels, and updates its independent English guides." canonicalPath="/about/">
  <article class="narrow section prose"><p class="eyebrow">About this site</p><h1>Help that shows its work</h1><p>{site.disclaimer}</p><h2>What we publish</h2><p>We organize public, attributable evidence into direct answers for progression blocks, bosses, island unlocks, achievements, items, and technical problems. We do not claim a large editorial team or first-hand testing that did not happen.</p><h2>How we handle evidence</h2><ul><li>Developer pages, the Steam store, achievements, and patch notes support official identity and version facts.</li><li>Gameplay guidance uses multiple attributable player sources when official instructions are incomplete.</li><li>Patch-sensitive or incomplete claims remain clearly limited, noindex, or unpublished until the evidence improves.</li></ul><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Every guide shows a source note and last-check date. Use the Contact page for correction and copyright requests once its verified email route is active.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>

